  description: 'Rush forward through walls with a spectral strike, landing at a safe position within range. Recast up to twice within 1.25s of each strike to redirect the combo. Basic attacks and the other move can be used between strikes. The third strike throws opponents into the air and slows them. Cooldown begins after the combo ends. Upgrade: stronger finisher and a movement-speed boost when it hits.'
